stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Pending: row inserted together with the state change
    Pending --> Leased: claimed, LeasedUntil = now + 30 s
    Leased --> Processed: hand-off accepted (outbox) or handler completed (delivery), MarkAsProcessed
    Leased --> Backoff: attempt failed, FailedAttempt (wait 20 / 40 / 80 / 160 s)
    Leased --> Pending: lease expired, instance died mid-publish
    Backoff --> Pending: NextAttemptOn reached
    Leased --> Dead: fifth failure, AttemptCount becomes 6, MarkMessageAsDead
    Processed --> [*]: deleted by the hourly cleanup after 7 days
    Dead --> [*]: excluded from the claim, no automatic replay, never deleted
    note right of Pending
        ProcessedOn null, IsDead false
        AttemptCount starts at 1
    end note
    note right of Dead
        IsDead true
        Errors keeps every message
    end note
